"Bankruptcy and debt","keywords":["bankruptcy","chapter 7","chapter 13","debt collector","foreclosure"],"referral":"a bankruptcy attorney through your local bar association's referral service"},{"id":"business","name":"Business formation and contracts","keywords":["llc","incorporate","business contract","startup","shareholder"],"referral":"a business attorney through your local bar association's referral service"},{"id":"housing","name":"Landlord-tenant and housing","keywords":["landlord","tenant","eviction","evicted","notice to quit","security deposit","locked out","lease"],"referral":"a housing or tenant attorney, or a legal aid office, through your local bar association's referral service"}],"referralNote":"Dyzania does not recommend a specific outside lawyer. It points people to their local bar association's referral service.","matchingNotes":"Phrases are matched as whole words or phrases in lowercase text. Before matching, 'real estate', 'in custody' and 'police custody' are removed, because they would otherwise hit estate or custody (family). Single common words such as 'will' and 'trust' are deliberately not keywords.","serviceArea":{"regionLabel":"Harlow Point and the surrounding area","options":["Harlow Point","Nearby area","Somewhere else"]}},"availability":{"note":"Weekly consultation windows in the firm's local time. A window is when an attorney can take first consultations; actual slots are cut from it by the booking code.","windows":{"dana-hollis":[{"day":"tue","start":"09:00","end":"12:00"},{"day":"thu","start":"13:00","end":"16:00"}],"marcus-marr":[{"day":"mon","start":"09:00","end":"12:00"},{"day":"wed","start":"13:00","end":"16:00"}],"elena-voss":[{"day":"mon","start":"10:00","end":"15:00"},{"day":"tue","start":"10:00","end":"15:00"},{"day":"thu","start":"10:00","end":"15:00"}],"tomas-reyes":[{"day":"tue","start":"10:00","end":"15:00"},{"day":"wed","start":"10:00","end":"15:00"},{"day":"fri","start":"10:00","end":"15:00"}]},"booking":{"horizonDays"